          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "request image comparison.\n@param ImageFilePath\tAbsolute path to the image location. All 8bit RGBA channels supported formats by the engine are accepted.\n@param ComparisonName\tOptional name for the comparison, by default the basename of ImageFilePath is used\n@return\t\t\t\tTrue if comparison was successfully enqueued"
